{"parse": {"title": "APPLe币", "pageid": 8582, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"APPLe币\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c9/CurrencyItem-100404.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"APPLe币\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>APPLe币</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-100404 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/CurrencyIcon-100404_1.png/24px-CurrencyIcon-100404_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/CurrencyIcon-100404_1.png/36px-CurrencyIcon-100404_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/CurrencyIcon-100404_1.png/48px-CurrencyIcon-100404_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"54\" data-file-height=\"54\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>2#1413</div></div><hr /><div>印有APPLe先生头像的镀铜货币，可用于修复APPLe&#160;Ⅱ号。<br />仅限“巨轮再度起航”活动期间使用。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">APPLe Ⅱ号的重建工程颇为艰巨，它囊括了各个方面。因此，星锑铸造了这种货币，用以清晰的量化重建过程——至于其用处如何，那就见仁见智了。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "APPLe币"}}